    "name": "Below Nowhere",
    "steam_appid": 2569280,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of <strong>Chicken Feet</strong> comes <strong>Below Nowhere</strong>, a first-person survival horror game about life, memories, second chances, and the Meat Man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/c1b754d100a8d059b295a951ca499be7.poster.avif?t=1747703367\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/c1b754d100a8d059b295a951ca499be7.webm?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/c1b754d100a8d059b295a951ca499be7.mp4?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped deep underground during humanity\u2019s final war, you are pulled into a shifting reality built from memories that aren\u2019t yours. Each place is different, yet they all share a tragic similarity: dried bloodshed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET THE MEAT MAN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't alone. The Meat Man feasts on evil and death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A trickster, the animalistic Meat Man likes to play with his food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Meat Man enjoys causing you pain and suffering more than anything.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/5c677db75a34ddd17d8afa129dbd16a8.poster.avif?t=1747703367\" width=606 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/5c677db75a34ddd17d8afa129dbd16a8.webm?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/5c677db75a34ddd17d8afa129dbd16a8.mp4?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPAIR YOUR BODY PARTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Meat Man will try to rip you apart piece by piece. Individual body parts can be injured, altering your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When heavily damaged, be wise! Medicine bottles are scarce. Be smart about the body parts you heal first.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your body is entirely exhausted, any extra injury will be fatal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/97aa2cf701e9a1e18b4c667a86645f7d.poster.avif?t=1747703367\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/97aa2cf701e9a1e18b4c667a86645f7d.webm?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/97aa2cf701e9a1e18b4c667a86645f7d.mp4?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A PLACE BELOW NOWHERE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the darkness and voyage through strange memories that aren't yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vicious Meat Man will be hunting you. Use the environment to your advantage and hide in the darkness where he can't see you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious white glowing doorways mark your escape. Reach them to be spared by the Meat Man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no way of defending yourself. Your only choices are to run, hide, or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features an original dark ambient soundtrack composed by The Nomad Communion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built with Unreal Engine 5.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/0f34660ff658677a27358a034ffb2b0f.avif?t=1747703367\" width=616 height=149 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of <strong>Chicken Feet</strong> comes <strong>Below Nowhere</strong>, a first-person survival horror game about life, memories, second chances, and the Meat Man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/c1b754d100a8d059b295a951ca499be7.poster.avif?t=1747703367\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/c1b754d100a8d059b295a951ca499be7.webm?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/c1b754d100a8d059b295a951ca499be7.mp4?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped deep underground during humanity\u2019s final war, you are pulled into a shifting reality built from memories that aren\u2019t yours. Each place is different, yet they all share a tragic similarity: dried bloodshed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET THE MEAT MAN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't alone. The Meat Man feasts on evil and death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A trickster, the animalistic Meat Man likes to play with his food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Meat Man enjoys causing you pain and suffering more than anything.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/5c677db75a34ddd17d8afa129dbd16a8.poster.avif?t=1747703367\" width=606 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/5c677db75a34ddd17d8afa129dbd16a8.webm?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/5c677db75a34ddd17d8afa129dbd16a8.mp4?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPAIR YOUR BODY PARTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Meat Man will try to rip you apart piece by piece. Individual body parts can be injured, altering your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When heavily damaged, be wise! Medicine bottles are scarce. Be smart about the body parts you heal first.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your body is entirely exhausted, any extra injury will be fatal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/97aa2cf701e9a1e18b4c667a86645f7d.poster.avif?t=1747703367\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/97aa2cf701e9a1e18b4c667a86645f7d.webm?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/97aa2cf701e9a1e18b4c667a86645f7d.mp4?t=1747703367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A PLACE BELOW NOWHERE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the darkness and voyage through strange memories that aren't yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vicious Meat Man will be hunting you. Use the environment to your advantage and hide in the darkness where he can't see you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious white glowing doorways mark your escape. Reach them to be spared by the Meat Man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no way of defending yourself. Your only choices are to run, hide, or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features an original dark ambient soundtrack composed by The Nomad Communion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built with Unreal Engine 5.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569280/extras/0f34660ff658677a27358a034ffb2b0f.avif?t=1747703367\" width=616 height=149 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A man made of red flesh is hunting you. He is the Meat Man. Below Nowhere is a first-person survival horror game that will pull you into the depths of evil. While exploring strange memories that aren't yours, you will be pushed to your limits in this terrifying tale of humanity and second chances.",
